---
import CompareLayout from '../../layouts/CompareLayout.astro'

const comparison = [
  { aspect: 'Primary purpose', sd: 'Transform and export tokens', buoy: 'Detect drift and measure adoption' },
  { aspect: 'Direction', sd: 'Tokens to code', buoy: 'Code to analysis' },
  { aspect: 'Detects hardcoded values', sd: 'No', buoy: 'Yes' },
  { aspect: 'Detects duplicates', sd: 'No', buoy: 'Yes' },
  { aspect: 'Adoption metrics', sd: 'No', buoy: 'Yes' },
  { aspect: 'CI enforcement', sd: 'No', buoy: 'Yes' },
  { aspect: 'Use together?', sd: 'Yes', buoy: 'Yes, a perfect pairing' },
]
---

<CompareLayout
  title="Buoy vs Style Dictionary | Drift Detection Not Just Token Transform"
  description="Style Dictionary transforms tokens. Buoy finds where tokens aren't being used. They work great together."
  keywords="style dictionary alternative, design token enforcement, token usage detection"
  heroTitle="Token Transform vs Token Enforcement"
  heroDescription="Style Dictionary transforms and exports tokens. Buoy ensures those tokens are actually being used."
  competitor="Style Dictionary"
>
  <div slot="hero" class="ui-tray"><div class="ui-panel">
    <div class="ui-panel-head">build/tokens.css, then Button.tsx</div>
    <pre class="hf-code"><code><span class="ui-t-dim">/* exported by Style Dictionary */</span>
--color-primary: #3b82f6;

<span class="ui-t-dim">// written by Copilot</span>
color: <span class="ui-old">#3b82f6</span>;</code></pre>
    <dl class="hf-rows">
      <div><dt>Style Dictionary</dt><dd class="hf-them">Token built and exported. Job done.</dd></div>
      <div><dt class="ui-c-buoy">Buoy</dt><dd>Token exists but isn't used: should be <span class="ui-token">var(--color-primary)</span></dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div></div>

  <section class="ui-section">
    <div class="ui-wrap">
      <div class="ui-cols">
        <article class="ui-col">
          <h3>Style Dictionary does</h3>
          <ul class="ui-ruled">
            <li>Transform tokens from one format to another</li>
            <li>Export to CSS, SCSS, JS, iOS, Android</li>
            <li>Single source of truth for token values</li>
            <li>Great build tool for design systems</li>
          </ul>
        </article>
        <article class="ui-col">
          <h3 class="ui-c-buoy">Buoy does</h3>
          <ul class="ui-ruled">
            <li>Find where tokens aren't being used</li>
            <li>Detect hardcoded values that bypass tokens</li>
            <li>Measure token adoption across codebase</li>
            <li>Enforce token usage in CI/CD</li>
          </ul>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ui-section ui-section--band">
    <div class="ui-wrap">
      <div class="ui-head"><h2>Feature comparison</h2></div>
      <table class="ui-table cmp-table mt-10">
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">Aspect</th><th scope="col">Style Dictionary</th><th scope="col" class="cmp-buoy">Buoy</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          {comparison.map((row) => (
            <tr><th scope="row">{row.aspect}</th><td class="cmp-them">{row.sd}</td><td class="cmp-buoy">{row.buoy}</td></tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ui-section">
    <div class="ui-wrap ui-split">
      <div>
        <div class="ui-head"><h2>The gap Style Dictionary doesn't fill</h2></div>
        <ol class="ui-steps">
          <li><span class="ui-step-n">1</span><div><p>You set up Style Dictionary beautifully</p></div></li>
          <li><span class="ui-step-n">2</span><div><p>Tokens export to <code class="ui-token">var(--color-primary)</code></p></div></li>
          <li><span class="ui-step-n">3</span><div><p>Developer asks Copilot to build a button</p></div></li>
          <li><span class="ui-step-n">4</span><div><p>Copilot writes <code class="ui-old">color: #3b82f6</code></p></div></li>
          <li><span class="ui-step-n">5</span><div><p>Code review misses it, PR merges</p></div></li>
          <li><span class="ui-step-n">6</span><div><p class="ui-c-warn">Your token exists but isn't being used</p></div></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <div class="ui-card ui-card--pad sd-with">
        <h3 class="cmp-sub">With Buoy</h3>
        <p>Buoy scans the codebase and reports the hardcoded <code class="ui-old">#3b82f6</code> with the token it should be, <code class="ui-token">var(--color-primary)</code>. The token exists. Now you know it's not being used.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ui-section ui-section--band">
    <div class="ui-wrap">
      <div class="ui-head">
        <h2>The perfect pairing</h2>
        <p>Style Dictionary creates and transforms your tokens. Buoy ensures they're actually being used.</p>
      </div>
      <ol class="ui-steps">
        <li><span class="ui-step-n">1</span><div><h3>Style Dictionary</h3><p>Create tokens</p></div></li>
        <li><span class="ui-step-n">2</span><div><h3>Codebase</h3><p>Use tokens</p></div></li>
        <li><span class="ui-step-n">3</span><div><h3 class="ui-c-buoy">Buoy</h3><p>Verify usage</p></div></li>
      </ol>
      <div class="ui-tray cmp-narrow"><div class="ui-panel">
        <div class="ui-panel-head">.buoy.yaml</div>
        <pre class="cmp-code"><code><span class="ui-t-dim"># Point Buoy at your Style Dictionary output</span>
tokens:
  source: <span class="ui-t-ok">"./build/tokens.json"</span></code></pre>
      </div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</CompareLayout>

<style>
  .cmp-sub { margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: var(--text-h3); color: var(--color-ink); }
  .sd-with { align-self: center; }
  .cmp-narrow { max-width: 560px; }
  .cmp-code { margin: 0; padding: 18px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; background: var(--color-term); color: var(--color-body); }
</style>

<style is:global>
  .hf-code { margin: 0; padding: 18px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; background: var(--color-term); color: var(--color-body); }
  .hf-rows { margin: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line); }
  .hf-rows > div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 96px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 12px; padding: 13px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-line); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; }
  .hf-rows > div:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  .hf-rows dt { font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-ink); }
  .hf-rows dd { margin: 0; color: var(--color-ink); }
  .hf-rows dd.hf-them { color: var(--color-muted); }
</style>
